。\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/749476684662833255/1104320790406627458/Taurtrain_anatomy_reference.doc?ex=66354621&is=6633f4a1&hm=a14dbd42f26fd13d56d01973879f199a5dcbbd90598a0ba24c3fa563d19c2cde&\n\n以下の点に重点を置く：\n- 適切な解剖学（例えば、前脚と後脚の違いなど）\n- 全身と、脚と翼のほとんど（できればすべて）を見せること。\n\n上記のすべてを満たした上で、以下のどれでもかまわない：\n- ポーズ", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Urusai_nu/works/114", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 787043, "client_id": 2218508, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2fb433f1/uploads/origins/7b802343-4946-4793-be7d-fdc2f91ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b67561fdb0d7091e26c4d7d5e6189af", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2fb433f1/uploads/origins/7b802343-4946-4793-be7d-fdc2f91ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d5b47768cccb4307a8b528be52981867", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\nキャラクターを描いてほしい。\nありがとうございました！\n-\nカーキのコートにスーツのズボン、レイバンのサングラス。\nフラッシュライトが顔を照らす。\n参考\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1XhfWnvtigHMuC4epMAayOwsVWPcM8uCG/view?usp=sharing\n-\nキャラクター\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1YETk2MnMqyCi6TZ99JbqwYNkUMGkxKNX/view?usp=drive_link\n-\n用途\nFurMIT個人の名刺や名札に。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Urusai_nu/works/113", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 787043, "client_id": 1898516, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/79b52ccf/uploads/origins/37ac2529-b2fa-4de1-9d61-ef8e36fe6538?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d69a247204101abcc312f52947850e3b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true,